<header class="hero" id="top">
  <video class="bgv" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto" poster="/media/hero.jpg?v=3" aria-hidden="true"><source src="/media/hero.mp4?v=3" type="video/mp4"></video>
  <div class="shade"></div>
  <div class="grain"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Every “done” checked. No more grep on <em>Opus</em>.</h1>
    <p class="sub">Horsy sends each subtask your agent spawns to the cheapest model that can do it, checks the result, and moves up one model if the check fails.</p>

    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="pill silk" href="#audit">Run <code>horsy audit</code> free</a>
      <a class="pill ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
    </div>
    <div id="audit">
      <div class="installbar"><span class="p">›</span><code id="cmd">/plugin install horsy</code><button type="button" aria-label="Copy install command" data-copy="#cmd">copy</button></div>
      <p class="fine">Then <code>/horsy audit</code> shows what your last sessions would have cost. Changes nothing. <b>Not published yet.</b></p>
    </div>
    <div class="personas"><span>On a Max plan: your quota lasts longer</span><span>Paying per token: grunt work stops costing Opus prices</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="track" role="img" aria-label="Animation: subtasks race in three model lanes. The small model passes the check. The mid model says done but fails the check. The frontier model picks it up and finishes.">
    <div class="lanes" id="lanes">
      <span class="gate-tag">verify</span>
      <div class="gate"></div>
      <div class="finish"></div>
      <div class="lane l1"><span class="lbl">small model<i>rename-symbol</i></span><div class="horse"><i class="gallop"></i></div><span class="chit ok">✓ $0.002 · 1.1s</span></div>
      <div class="lane l2"><span class="lbl">mid model<i>write-test-stub</i></span><div class="horse"><i class="gallop"></i></div><span class="chit ko">✗ “done”, file empty → step up</span></div>
      <div class="lane l3"><span class="lbl">frontier model<i>write-test-stub</i></span><div class="horse"><i class="gallop"></i></div><span class="chit ok">✓ verified · $0.061</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="track-cap">cheapest first → verify → step up only if it fails</p>
  </div>
  <div style="height:170px"></div>
</header>
